==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:It's Too Quiet...]] in order to do [[Quest:Rescue in the Ruins]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Sarkin Stonehearth]] found at [[The Dig]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Sarkin wants you to rescue Assistant Bogse in the Precursor Ruins in Sunstone Valley.
*Rescue Assistant Bogse
*Return to Sarkin Stonehearth
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Sarkin Stonehearth]] found at [[The Dig]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Wait... where’s Bogse? Oh no. The spiders must have grabbed him!<br /><Player Name>, we have to <font color='#D9781A'>save Assistant Bogse</font>, but I can barely stand with this poison running through me. Please, you’re the only one that has a chance of finding him in the <font color='D9781A'>Precursor Ruins</font>." -Sarkin Stonehearth
#Rescue Assistant Bogse
#*[[Assistant Bogse]] is rescued by completing [[Precursor Ruins]] [[Sunstone Valley]] [[Dungeons|Dungeon]].
#Speak with [[Sarkin Stonehearth]] found at [[The Dig]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"You saved Bogse AND discovered the greatest find I’ve ever heard of! Functioning Precursor artifacts? Unbelievable! Studying them may be a problem, but I’m sure we’ll figure out something.<br />And <Player Name>, if you ever need anything from me or my crew, you just come back here and let me know. As far as I’m concerned we’re pals for life!" -Sarkin Stonehearth
